只输出严格JSON，恰好包含id（metadata.id原样）、summary_zh（15到140个Unicode字符，通常40到100字）、category（枚举）、tags（2到5个不重复关键词，每个最多30字符）、confidence（0到1，仅自评）、insufficient_evidence（布尔）、evidence（1到3个对象，每个恰好包含paragraph_id、fact）、limitations（0到5个字符串）。只选择输入中长度20至120字符的完整片段编号；fact是该片段支持的中文事实转述。不要输出quote，不要自行抄写、拼接、删改或补造引用。程序会按编号附上原文。一个编号只用一次；最多3条证据。不得增加字段。
摘要和limitations保留会改变功能意义的前提、平台例外和限制：设密码后才认证、页面保持打开才提醒、依赖外部组件、估算不等于保证。只写已实现功能，不将规划当完成。证据不足就标记，不编造。
图像识别/分类不是媒体创作，没有贴切类别归other；量化、计算与领域研究归search-research，不因多智能体实现归agents-automation；模型/CLI适配与插件开发工具归coding-development；市场/精选目录按搜索发现归search-research。不要按附属同步、备份或评论功能分类。不要推断本机客户端等于本地模型。
摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Bring OpenCode Zen's free models to DeepSeek Harness — zero config, no API key, catalog discovered live from upstream","id":"gh:1339082867","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-opencode-zen","slug":"keman-ai/dsh-opencode-zen","topics":["deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","free-models","llm","openai-compatible","plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Bring OpenCode Zen's free models to DeepSeek Harness — zero config, no API key, catalog discovered l"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"n's free models to DeepSeek Harness — zero config, no API key, catalog discovered live from upstream"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"DSH OpenCode Zen"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"Bring OpenCode Zen's free models to\nDeepSeek Harness."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"No signup, no API key, no balance to top up."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"English · 简体中文"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"If this is useful to you, a Star goes a long way"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"Install it and configure nothing. Zen's free models accept anonymous calls, so once the\nplugin boots"},{"id":"p7s2","text":", a group of working models simply appears in the model picker."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"All seven **support tool calls and reasoning content**, enough to run a full agent\nloop — not a chat"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"port tool calls and reasoning content**, enough to run a full agent\nloop — not a chat-only cut-down."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"The list is not hardcoded; it is fetched at runtime: models.dev decides *which are free\nand how larg"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"e*, Zen's model endpoint decides *which still exist*, and the plugin takes\nthe intersection. Free mo"},{"id":"p10s3","text":"dels are offered for a limited time, so any hardcoded list is\nguaranteed to go stale."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"Not published to npm — install from GitHub:"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"Then **restart dsh once**, and the `opencode-zen` group appears in the model picker."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"Three notes:"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"- **`-w` is not optional.** The profile directory ships a `pnpm-workspace.yaml`, so pnpm\ntreats it a"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"s a workspace root; without the flag you get `ERR_PNPM_ADDING_TO_ROOT`.\n- **No build-script authoris"},{"id":"p16s3","text":"ation needed.** The repository ships its build output and has\nno `prepare` script, so pnpm runs no b"},{"id":"p16s4","text":"uild for a git source. You do not need\n`allowBuilds`, nor a build toolchain on your machine.\n- **`--"},{"id":"p16s5","text":"profile` is whichever you already use** (`web` or `headless`). This is an LLM\nprovider; it does not "},{"id":"p16s6","text":"depend on the web GUI."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"To confirm it really entered the Loader tree:"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"To hack on it, install locally:"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"## Do I need an API key"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"**No.** Anonymous calls draw on Zen's shared free quota. It is rate-limited by source —\nplenty for t"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"rying things out, though sustained volume will hit `FreeUsageLimitError`."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"For a private quota, grab a key at opencode.ai/zen:"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"The variable name matches opencode's own, so if you already use opencode, one key serves\nboth. You c"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"an also store it in the credentials service from dsh's **Models** page; the\nplugin reads that first."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"When the quota runs out, the plugin does not just say `Rate limit exceeded` — it tells you\nwhether y"},{"id":"p26s2","text":"ou are anonymous or keyed, and what to do next."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"## Configuration"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"All optional. An empty config gives the behaviour described above."},{"id":"p29s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"## Known limits"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"- **The free quota is shared**, and anonymous calls hit the limiter most easily. That is\nZen's polic"},{"id":"p31s2","text":"y; all the plugin can do is state the reason clearly.\n- **Reasoning is not sent back.** OpenAI-compa"},{"id":"p31s3","text":"tible `chat/completions` has no request\nfield to carry the previous turn's thinking, so reasoning bl"},{"id":"p31s4","text":"ocks are displayed, not replayed.\n- **Text only.** All seven models take text alone; an image in a t"},{"id":"p31s5","text":"ool result is replaced\nwith a one-line placeholder rather than dropped silently.\n- **Paid models are"},{"id":"p31s6","text":" excluded.** Zen also offers Claude, GPT and others, but this plugin\nexists so that things run with "},{"id":"p31s7","text":"zero configuration — mixing paid models into the same\nlist makes it unclear which choice costs money"},{"id":"p31s8","text":". To use them, add an `llm-deepseek`\nentry pointing at the same endpoint."},{"id":"p32s1","text":"## Development"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"**`lib/` is committed on purpose.** This package is not published to npm; everyone\ninstalls from a g"},{"id":"p34s2","text":"it source, and whether pnpm can build a git source depends on the other\nmachine's toolchain and `all"},{"id":"p34s3","text":"owBuilds` grants. Shipping the output removes that variable —\n**commit the `pnpm build` output along"},{"id":"p34s4","text":" with your code changes.**"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"| File | Responsibility |"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"| `src/index.ts` | Plugin entry: config validation, credential resolution, provider registration on "},{"id":"p36s2","text":"`ctx.llm` |\n| `src/adapter.ts` | `LlmAdapter` implementation: requests, error mapping, model metadat"},{"id":"p36s3","text":"a |\n| `src/stream.ts` | State machine turning SSE deltas into the harness block sequence |\n| `src/di"},{"id":"p36s4","text":"scovery.ts` | Two-source merge, caching and fallback for the free catalog |"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"## Related"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"- OpenCode Zen — the model gateway itself; keys come from here\n- DeepSeek Harness — the host\n- dsh-s"},{"id":"p38s2","text":"kin-market — skin marketplace plugin by the same people\n- dsh-skin-pack — the official skins, all in"},{"id":"p38s3","text":"in marketplace plugin by the same people\n- dsh-skin-pack — the official skins, all in one repository"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p40s1","text":"MIT © 2026 Science Roam Limited"},{"id":"p41s1","text":"If this is useful to you, a Star goes a long way"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
